AMBARI-8867.  Ensure that bluepint deployment sets each
 config type on cluster               no more than once

Here is the root cause:
The bug arises from the logic in the `ClusterResourceProvider` class that allows the same configuration type to be added multiple times during the blueprint deployment process. This can lead to inconsistencies and errors in the cluster configuration, as the same settings may be applied redundantly, causing conflicts or unexpected behavior.

